<SCENARIO VER="105">
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "BGM死月編\紅葉のダンス.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家洗面所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"So <STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>'s bringing her friends, huh... 
{PAUSE ""}
While I'm at it, I want to pull a prank with as much impact as <STYLE ID="2">Grandma</STYLE>'s, at least."<PG>
"Yeah, everyone's going to use the toilet... 
{PAUSE ""}
Maybe around here?
{PAUSE ""}
　Hup."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{PLAYSND "エデンの桜\SE\ノック重い.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "2000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"Hmm, the ceiling won't come off after all... 
{PAUSE ""}
Okay, I'll just remodel it!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Huh? </STYLE>Kana<STYLE ID="3">, what are you doing up on a chair in a place like this?"</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
"Huh!? No, no, it's nothing!
{PAUSE ""}
　<STYLE ID="1">Haruka-chan</STYLE>'s friends are coming soon, so I was just thinking about what kind of welcome to give them!"
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CHANGECG "人物1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\人物\詫言編　始まり以降\幸太郎腰に手バストアップ.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
<STYLE ID="3">"Hahaha! Welcoming them is fine, but don't overdo it!"</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "人物1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"If you don't overdo it a bit, there's no impact. 
{PAUSE ""}
It's got to be thrilling and passionate, after all!"<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "000" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
"All right, all right, the toilet and the washroom are connected now!
{PAUSE ""}
　And then..."<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\サード\新村本家洗面所.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\リファレンス用\アイテム\般若.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "R" "B" "0" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{MESON "500"}
"Heehee, if I hide this Noh mask in the space above the ceiling, it'll be perfect!
{PAUSE ""}
　Kana Niimura's Prank☆Welcome Plan, ready to go!"<BR>
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "3000" "PASS"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<PG>
{}
